arch:ContentSnapshot a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf prov:Entity .
arch:ExtractionRun a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf prov:Activity .
arch:Evidence a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf prov:Entity .
arch:RelationshipAssertion a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf prov:Entity .
arch:LogicalDocument a owl:Class .
arch:DocumentRevision a owl:Class .
arch:DrawingSheet a owl:Class .
arch:IssueEvent a owl:Class .
arch:SubmissionPackage a owl:Class .
arch:ReviewRound a owl:Class .
