arch:Site a owl:Class .
arch:Building a owl:Class .
arch:PermitCase a owl:Class .
arch:SharedReferenceCollection a owl:Class .
arch:DrawingElementObservation a owl:Class .
arch:MeasurementObservation a owl:Class .
arch:LegalRule a owl:Class .
arch:RuleSetVersion a owl:Class .
arch:ComplianceCheck a owl:Class .
